# Event Ticketing API

A RESTful API built with Node.js, Express, and MongoDB for managing events, bookings, and users with JWT authentication and role-based access control.

---

## Features

### User Features
- User registration and login
- View events
- Filter events by category and date
- Book tickets
- View own bookings

### Admin Features
- Create, update, and delete events
- View all bookings per event (dashboard)
- Manage seat capacity

### Security
- JWT authentication
- Password hashing with bcrypt
- Role-based access control (user/admin)
- Protected routes

### Bonus Features
- QR code generation for bookings
- QR ticket validation endpoint
- Email confirmation using Nodemailer
- Admin dashboard for event analytics

---

## Tech Stack

- Node.js
- Express.js
- MongoDB & Mongoose
- JWT Authentication
- bcryptjs
- Nodemailer
- qrcode
- dotenv

---

